    "body": "Main was merged into this branch. New head: 5bbd29c1e.\n\nOne file conflicted: `crates/app/src/operation/stitch.rs`. Main added a `setup` parameter to `gather_runs`. This branch made `gather_runs` `pub(super)`. The resolution keeps both changes.\n\nBecause of the new parameter, `open_band.rs` now passes `setup` to `gather_runs` and to `stitch_open_runs`. The open-edge band lane keeps the setup-frame pose of the picked edges, as the other lanes do. No check or refusal was removed.\n\nTests run, all passed: `open_band` (7, camcraft-app), the `open_band` lib tests (3), `opframe_seam` (8), `stitch_cross` (6).\n\nThe merge needs a delta review of the `stitch.rs` and `open_band.rs` change.\n",
